      "core_meaning_cn": "从味觉“苦”扩展到心理体验：可指味道苦、经历痛苦难以接受，也可指人因怨恨而愤愤不平",
      "core_meaning_en": "bitter can describe sharp taste, painful/hard-to-accept experience, or resentful anger",
      "mental_model_cn": "taste/food → 苦味；disappointment/defeat/truth → 痛苦、难接受；person/enemy/resentment → 怀恨、愤愤不平。",
